      "title": "Briton swims length of strait of Hormuz to highlight environmental cost of war",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/briton-lewis-pugh-swims-strait-of-hormuz-environment-war",
      "description": "<p>UN patron Lewis Pugh saw ships ablaze and fighter jets overhead during three-day swim as Iran conflict continues</p><p>A British endurance swimmer has completed a three-day swim through the strait of Hormuz to highlight the environmental cost of the Iran war.</p><p>Lewis Pugh, a UN patron of the oceans, swam the 9.3-mile (15km) length of the waterway, which is a key route for oil shipments from the Middle East.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/briton-lewis-pugh-swims-strait-of-hormuz-environment-war\">Continue reading...</a>",
